### use

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl use forall t. (x : t) : t =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()\n        Lua = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()\n        Fsharp = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()\n        Python = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()\n        Cpp = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()\n        // Rust: F#'s `use` disposes at the end of the scope; a Drop guard over the disposable's closure.\n        Rust = fun () =>\n            global \"struct SpiralUse(std::rc::Rc<dyn Fn()>);\\nimpl Drop for SpiralUse {\\n    fn drop(&mut self) { (self.0)() }\\n}\"\n            $'let _spiral_use = SpiralUse((!x).clone())' : ()\n    }\n    $'!x '","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl use forall t. (x : t) : t =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()
          Lua = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()
          Fsharp = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()
          Python = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()
          Cpp = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()
          TypeScript = fun () => $'use !x = !x ' : ()
          // Rust: F#'s `use` disposes at the end of the scope; a Drop guard over the disposable's closure.
          Rust = fun () =>
              global "struct SpiralUse(std::rc::Rc<dyn Fn()>);\nimpl Drop for SpiralUse {\n    fn drop(&mut self) { (self.0)() }\n}"
              $'let _spiral_use = SpiralUse((!x).clone())' : ()
      }
      $'!x '
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

