### run_target (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> gleam\n///> lua\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n///> rust\n///> typescript\n\nrun_target function\n    | Gleam => fun () => $'1 + 1'\n    | Lua => fun () => $'1 + 1'\n    | Fsharp => fun () => $'1uy + 1uy'\n    | Cuda => fun () => $'1 + 1'\n    | Rust => fun () => $'1u8 + 1u8'\n    | TypeScript => fun () => $'1 + 1'\n    | _ => fun () => $'2uy + 2uy'\n|> _assert_eq 2u8","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ///> gleam
  ///> lua
  ///> fsharp
  ///> cuda
  ///> rust
  ///> typescript

  run_target function
      | Gleam => fun () => $'1 + 1'
      | Lua => fun () => $'1 + 1'
      | Fsharp => fun () => $'1uy + 1uy'
      | Cuda => fun () => $'1 + 1'
      | Rust => fun () => $'1u8 + 1u8'
      | TypeScript => fun () => $'1 + 1'
      | _ => fun () => $'2uy + 2uy'
  |> _assert_eq 2u8
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

