### join_body

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl join_body body acc x =\n    if var_is x |> not\n    then body acc x\n    else\n        inl acc = dyn acc\n        join body acc x","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl join_body body acc x =
      if var_is x |> not
      then body acc x
      else
          inl acc = dyn acc
          join body acc x
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

