### join_body_unit

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl join_body_unit body d x =\n    if var_is d |> not\n    then body x\n    else\n        inl x = dyn x\n        join body x","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl join_body_unit body d x =
      if var_is d |> not
      then body x
      else
