### (=.)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl (=.) forall t. (a : t) (b : t) : bool =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () => $'!a == !b ' : bool\n        Lua = fun () => $'!a == !b ' : bool\n        Fsharp = fun () => $'!a = !b ' : bool\n        Python = fun () => $'!a == !b ' : bool\n        Rust = fun () => $'!a == !b ' : bool\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'!a === !b ' : bool\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl (=.) forall t. (a : t) (b : t) : bool =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () => $'!a == !b ' : bool
          Lua = fun () => $'!a == !b ' : bool
          Fsharp = fun () => $'!a = !b ' : bool
          Python = fun () => $'!a == !b ' : bool
          Rust = fun () => $'!a == !b ' : bool
          TypeScript = fun () => $'!a === !b ' : bool
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> gleam\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n///> rust\n///> typescript\n\n(($'-3' : i32) =. ($'-3' : i32))\n|> _assert_eq true","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
